# Every file here is generated by the Astro build with a content hash in
# its own filename (e.g. "index.a1b2c3d4.css") — a content change always
# produces a new filename, never overwrites an already-published hash.
# That's what makes a full year of "immutable" caching safe here, unlike
# the rest of the site (see the root .htaccess).
<IfModule mod_headers.c>
  Header set Cache-Control "public, max-age=31536000, immutable"
</IfModule>
